<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170654942537" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Ngowahi Frasa Inggris dadi Wujud Aljabar</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655163394">Mau kita wis ndeleng simbol operasi lan ngowahi wujud aljabar lan persamaan dadi frasa lan ukara. Saiki dibalik: saka frasa Inggris menyang wujud aljabar. Simbol lan variabel sing wis dirembug bakal mbantu. Ing kéné ana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa; frasa Inggris asline bisa diwaca ing pranala sumber. <link target-id="fs-id1170655166578"/> ngringkes simbol lan frasa mau.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655166578" aria-label="Tabel iki ana limang larik lan telung kolom: Operasi, Frasa nganggo basa Jawa, lan Wujud aljabar. Nambah: a ditambah b; gunggung a lan b; a ditambahi b; b ditambahké menyang a; totalé a lan b; b ditambahake marang a. Kabeh tegesé a ditambah b. Ngurangi: a kurang b; salisih a lan b; a disuda b; b dijupuk saka a; b dijupuk saka a. Kabeh tegesé a dikurangi b. Ping-pingan: a ping b utawa asil ping-pingan a lan b, ditulis a titik b, ab, a kurung b, utawa kurung a kurung b. Ping pindho saka a ditulis 2a. Paran: a dipara b; asil paran a lan b; rasio a lan b; b dadi pambagi kanggo a. Ditulis a tandha para b, a garis miring b, pecahan kanthi a ing ndhuwur b, utawa para gapit kanthi b ing njaba lan a ing njero.">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="middle" align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">Frasa: tegesé nganggo basa Jawa</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">Wujud aljabar</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Nambah</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> ditambah <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
gunggung saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> ditambahi <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> ditambahké menyang <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math><newline/>
totalé <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> ditambahake marang <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Ngurangi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> kurang <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
salisih saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> disuda <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> dijupuk saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> dijupuk saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Ping-pingan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> ping <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
asil ping-pingan saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
ping pindho saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline/><newline/>
2<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Paran</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
asil paran saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
rasio saka <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> dadi pambagi kanggo <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mtext>/</m:mtext><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:menclose notation="longdiv"><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:menclose></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655190784">Delengen tenanan frasa nganggo patang operasi iki:</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655105929" alt="Ana patang frasa Inggris: “the sum of a and b”, “the difference of a and b”, “the product of a and b”, lan “the quotient of a and b”. Rerangken “of a and” ing saben frasa ditulis abang, kalebu aksara a. Iki nuduhake gunggungé a lan b, salisihé a lan b, asil pingé a lan b, lan asilé a dipara b.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../assets/canonical/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_015_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<para id="fs-id1170655227649">Saben frasa ngandhani operasi lan urutan rong wilangan. Ing frasa Inggris, goleka tembung <emphasis effect="italics">of</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">and</emphasis>  supaya ngerti rong wilangan lan urutané.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170655354222">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655354224">
<problem id="fs-id1170655355492">
<para id="fs-id1170655355494">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> salisih saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> asil paran saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655117312">
<title>Carané</title>
<list id="fs-id1166425197914" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Tembung sing dadi pituduh yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">“difference”, tegesé salisih</emphasis>, tegese operasi ngurangi. Ing frasa Inggris, goleka tembung <emphasis effect="italics">of</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">and</emphasis> supaya ngerti wilangan wiwitan lan sing dijupuk saka kuwi.<newline/>
<media id="fs-id1170655127844" alt="Gambare ana telung larik: “the difference of 17x and 5”, kanthi “of” lan “and” ditulis abang; banjur “17x minus 5”; pungkasane 17x − 5. Tegesé 5 dijupuk saka 17x, ora dibalik.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../assets/canonical/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_016_img_new.jpg"/>
</media><newline/><newline/></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Tembung “quotient” tegese asil paran, mula operasine mbagi.</item>
</list>
<media id="fs-id1170655111048" alt="Gambar iki nuduhake frasa “the quotient of 10x squared and 7”, banjur pituduh mbagi 10x kuadrat nganggo 7, banjur 10x² ÷ 7. Tembung “of” lan “and” ing frasa ndhuwur ditulis abang. Sing dipara 10x kuadrat; pambaginé 7.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../assets/canonical/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_018_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<para id="fs-id1167265670725">Iki uga bisa ditulis <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mtext>/</m:mtext><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>utawa</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655163327" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655163331">
<problem id="fs-id1170655163333">
<para id="fs-id1170655208557">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> salisih saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan 13 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> asil paran saka 12<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan 2.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655215532">
<para id="fs-id1170655215534"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655351939" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655161309">
<problem id="fs-id1170655161311">
<para id="fs-id1170655161313">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> gunggung saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> asil ping-pingan saka <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655106926">
<para id="fs-id1170655106928"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 7<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655207371">Wolung taun manèh umurmu pira? Tambahna 8 menyang umurmu saiki. Pitung taun kepungkur umurmu pira? Jupuken 7 saka umurmu saiki. Dadi “eight more than” lan “seven less than” ing kéné iku pituduh operasi, dudu mung mbandhingaké umur.</para>

<example id="fs-id1170655207375">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655166193">
<problem id="fs-id1170654972284">
<para id="fs-id1170654972286">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> Pitulas ditambahké menyang <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> Sanga dijupuk saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655229585">
<title>Carané</title>
<list id="fs-id1166424865853" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Tembung sing dadi pituduh yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">“more than”.</emphasis> Iki ngandhani supaya nambah. <emphasis effect="italics">“More than”</emphasis> tegese “ditambahake marang”.<newline/>
<equation id="fs-id1166424900029" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>Pitulas ditambahké menyang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>Pitulas ditambahake marang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Tembung sing dadi pituduh yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">“less than”</emphasis>. Iki ngandhani supaya ngurangi. <emphasis effect="italics">“Less than”</emphasis> tegese “dijupuk saka”.<newline/>
<equation id="fs-id1166424997640" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr/><m:mtr/><m:mtr/><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="5em"/><m:mtext>Sanga dijupuk saka</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="5em"/><m:mtext>Sanga dijupuk saka</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="5em"/><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation></item>
</list>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655204422" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655204426">
<problem id="fs-id1170655204428">
<para id="fs-id1170655204430">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> Sewelas ditambahké menyang <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> Patbelas dijupuk saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655200450">
<para id="fs-id1170655200452"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655164739" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655164744">
<problem id="fs-id1170655164746">
<para id="fs-id1170655164748">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> 13 ditambahké menyang <emphasis effect="italics">z</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 18 dijupuk saka 8<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655129023">
<para id="fs-id1170655129025"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>z</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170655104992">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655104994">
<problem id="fs-id1170655104997">
<para id="fs-id1170655104999">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> lima ping gunggung saka <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> gunggung saka lima ping <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655190682">
<title>Carané</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655114108">Ana rong tembung sing nuduhake operasi: <emphasis effect="italics">“times” (ping)</emphasis> nuduhake operasi ping-pingan, dene <emphasis effect="italics">“sum” (gunggung)</emphasis> ngandhani supaya nambah.</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424761248" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
<item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Amarga frasa iki tegesé 5 ping kabèh gunggung, kurung kudu ngapit gunggung saka <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dadi gunggung mau diitung dhisik. Elinga urutan operasi.<newline/>
<equation id="fs-id1166420322683" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr/><m:mtr/><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>lima ping gunggung saka</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Kanggo nggoleki gunggung, delengen “of” lan “and” ing frasa Inggris: kuwi nuduhake apa sing ditambah. Ing kéné, gunggung mau dumadi <emphasis effect="italics">saka</emphasis> lima ping <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>.<newline/>
<equation id="fs-id1166424760024" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>gunggung</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>saka</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>lima ping</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation></item>
</list>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655171042" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655177754">
<problem id="fs-id1170655177756">
<para id="fs-id1170655177758">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> papat ping gunggung saka <emphasis effect="italics">p</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> gunggung saka papat ping <emphasis effect="italics">p</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655197238">
<para id="fs-id1170655197241"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654989451" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655113787">
<problem id="fs-id1170655113789">
<para id="fs-id1170655113791">Owahana tegesé nganggo basa Jawa dadi wujud aljabar; frasa Inggris asliné ana ing pranala sumber: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> salisih saka loro ping <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan 8, <span class="token">ⓑ</span> loro ping salisih saka <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan 8.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655157598">
<para id="fs-id1170655099451"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655121539">Mengko aljabar iki dienggo ngrampungake masalah saben dina. Wiwitane, owahana frasane dadi wujud aljabar. Rong tuladha sabanjure nuduhake carane.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170655121545"><exercise id="fs-id1170655121547">
<problem id="fs-id1170655121549">
<para id="fs-id1170655120589">Ambané pasagi dawa kuwi dawané dikurangi 6. Nganggoa <emphasis effect="italics">l</emphasis> kanggo makili dawané pasagi dawa. Tulisen wujud aljabar kanggo ambané.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655162128">
<title>Carané</title>
<table id="eip-72" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki ana papat larik lan rong kolom tanpa judhul. Kiwa isiné langkah, tengen isiné frasa utawa wujud aljabar. Ambané iku dawané dikurangi 6. Dawané ditulis l. “6 less than l” tegesé 6 dijupuk saka l; asilé l − 6.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen frasa kanggo ambané pasagi dawa.</entry>
    <entry>frasa Inggris “6 less than the length”</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Nganggoa <m:math><m:mi>l</m:mi></m:math> kanggo makili “dawane”.</entry>
    <entry>frasa Inggris “6 less than” nganggo  <m:math><m:mi>l</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana “less than” dadi pituduh “dijupuk saka”; sing ana ing tengen dadi wilangan wiwitan.</entry>
    <entry>6 dijupuk saka <m:math><m:mi>l</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana frasa mau dadi aljabar.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mi>l</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table>

</solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1170655332442" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655332446">
<problem id="fs-id1170655332449">
<para id="fs-id1170655190394">Dawané pasagi dawa kuwi ambané dikurangi 7. Nganggoa <emphasis effect="italics">w</emphasis> kanggo makili ambané pasagi dawa. Tulisen wujud aljabar kanggo dawané.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655190404">
<para id="fs-id1170654937336"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>w</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655270004" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655270008">
<problem id="fs-id1170655270010">
<para id="fs-id1170655270012">Ambané pasagi dawa kuwi dawané dikurangi 6. Nganggoa <emphasis effect="italics">l</emphasis> kanggo makili dawané pasagi dawa. Tulisen wujud aljabar kanggo ambané.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655207305">
<para id="fs-id1170655207307"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>l</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170655189882"><exercise id="fs-id1170655189045">
<problem id="fs-id1170655189047">
<para id="fs-id1170655189049">June nduwé koin AS sepuluh sen, jenengé dime, lan koin 25 sen, jenengé quarter. Cacah dime kuwi cacah quarter diping papat, banjur dikurangi telu. Nganggoa <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis> kanggo makili cacah koin quarter. Tulisen wujud aljabar kanggo cacah koin dime.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655352055">
<title>Carané</title>
<table id="eip-470" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki ana papat larik lan rong kolom. Kiwa langkah, tengen frasa utawa wujud aljabar. Cacah quarter ditulis q, diping papat dadi 4q, banjur telu dijupuk saka 4q. Dadi cacah dime yaiku 4q − 3.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen frasa kanggo cacah dime.</entry>
    <entry>telu dijupuk saka papat ping cacah koin quarter</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Nganggoa <m:math><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math> kanggo makili cacah quarter.</entry>
    <entry>frasa Inggris “3 less than 4 times” nganggo q; teges operasiné 3 dijupuk saka 4 ping  <m:math><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana frasa “4 ping <m:math><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math>”.</entry>
    <entry>3 dijupuk saka <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
<row>
    <entry>Owahana frasa mau dadi aljabar.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170654919848" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654919852">
<problem id="fs-id1170654919854">
<para id="fs-id1170654919856">Geoffrey nduwé koin AS sepuluh sen, jenengé dime, lan koin 25 sen, jenengé quarter. Cacah dime kuwi cacah quarter diping papat, banjur dikurangi wolu. Nganggoa <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis> kanggo makili cacah koin quarter. Tulisen wujud aljabar kanggo cacah koin dime.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655195241">
<para id="fs-id1170655195243"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655020555" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655020559">
<problem id="fs-id1170655020561">
<para id="fs-id1170655020563">Lauren nduwé koin AS sepuluh sen, jenengé dime, lan koin lima sen, jenengé nickel. Cacah dime kuwi cacah nickel diping pitu, banjur ditambah telu. Nganggoa <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> kanggo makili cacah koin nickel. Tulisen wujud aljabar kanggo cacah koin dime.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654940350">
<para id="fs-id1170654940352"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>